// WHICH SET A BARROWS PIECE BELONGS TO, on the twenty-four undamaged pieces only: 1 Ahrim,
// 2 Dharok, 3 Guthan, 4 Karil, 5 Torag, 6 Verac, which is each brother's ^barrows_bit_* plus one
// so that 0 can mean "not a Barrows piece".
//
// The hundred and twenty DEGRADED stages carry nothing new, because they already carry
// param=fixed pointing back at the piece they repair into - so ~barrows_set_piece asks for the
// set, and asks again through param=fixed when the answer is nothing. A 0% piece resolves to its
// set the same way, and cannot satisfy a set effect anyway: the cache gives it no iop2=Wear, so
// it can never be in the worn inventory at all.
[barrows_set]
type=int
default=0
